									"CALENDAR_ENTRY_REJECTED"
								],
								"type": "string"
							},
							"type": "array"
						},
						"version": {
							"description": "The payload format version of the webhook. Version 2026-07-27 adds generated ICS calendar content (`attendeeIcsContent`, `organizerIcsContent`) to BOOKING_CREATED, BOOKING_RESCHEDULED, BOOKING_CANCELLED, BOOKING_SEAT_ACCEPTED, and BOOKING_PAID (when the payment accepted the booking) payloads. Every version's builder-produced payload carries a `payload.platformOAuthClientId` field naming the owning platform OAuth client (`null` for non-platform events; for the flat-delivered MEETING_STARTED/MEETING_ENDED bodies the field appears at the top level of the body). Zapier deliveries, custom payload templates that do not reference the field, the `AFTER_HOSTS_CAL_VIDEO_NO_SHOW` / `AFTER_GUESTS_CAL_VIDEO_NO_SHOW` bodies (delivered verbatim from the fire-time blob, never built) and the legacy `FORM_SUBMITTED_NO_EVENT` fallback delivery omit it.",
							"enum": [
